*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0018
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-05-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 968
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0018.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> CLAIM TYPE A=AUTO H=HOME M=MEDICAL
    05 CLM-TYPE-CD        PIC X.
       88 CLM-MEDICAL VALUE 'M'.
    *> CLAIMED AMOUNT
    05 CLM-AMOUNT         PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> POLICY DEDUCTIBLE
    05 DEDUCTIBLE-AMT     PIC 9(5)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 SETTLE-AMT         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    05 CLM-STAT-CD        PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM CALC-PAYOUT
    DISPLAY "SETTLE-AMT=" SETTLE-AMT
    DISPLAY "CLM-STAT-CD=" CLM-STAT-CD
    STOP RUN.
CALC-PAYOUT.
    *> MEDICAL CO-INSURANCE
    IF CLM-MEDICAL
        COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT = CLM-AMOUNT * 0.70
    ELSE IF CLM-AMOUNT > 0
        COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT = CLM-AMOUNT - DEDUCTIBLE-AMT
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO SETTLE-AMT
        MOVE 'D' TO CLM-STAT-CD
    END-IF
    END-IF.
